// Golden vectors, reference values, composition, determinism and the stage
// entry point of the elevation stage (spec P1-01 sections 3, 9, 10.3 and
// 10.4, fourth version; P1-00 D10 and section 13.1).
//
// The golden vectors in worldgen/tests/golden/p1-01-elevation.txt were
// generated by worldgen/tests/reference/p1_elevation_reference.py, the test
// writer's exact-integer reference written from the spec alone; it
// reproduces every grid hash printed in P1-01 10.4.1 at N = 64, 128 and 256
// (and at 512 and 1024 where it was run), and with the neutral settings
// every value of 10.4.2. Each golden case is run step by step through the
// seams, so a failure names the first step that diverges.
//
// Slow checks (the N = 512 golden cases, N = 512 thread counts, N = 1024
// reference hashes, the 13.1 sweep) are in the test suite "elevation-slow",
// skipped by default:
//   worldgen-tests -ts=elevation-slow --no-skip

